# Date words that alone take a more frequent non-date sense. A preposition,
# article, demonstrative, number or year beside the word keeps the date sense.
# miércoles: euphemistic interjection for "mierda" (DLE "miércoles", 2.
# interj. eufem. coloq.). The weekday takes an article or a preposition: "el
# miércoles", "este miércoles", "hasta el miércoles".
miércoles
